# Wormhole MCP Server

Hosted MCP server for **Wormhole** — giving AI agents direct access to cross-chain bridging and messaging.

> Powered by [Junct](https://junct.dev) — the agent-readiness layer for DeFi.

## Quick Connect

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "wormhole": {
      "url": "https://wormhole.mcp.junct.dev/mcp"
    }
  }
}
```

## About

Wormhole is a cross-chain messaging protocol enabling token bridging and data transfer across 30+ blockchains. This MCP server provides 69 tools for AI agents to access Wormhole's API.

